i/images/0/0f/Giragiratchi_on_sale.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260505224229"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Giragiratchi_presents_Memetchi_with_MC_Puppetchi.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/8/80/Giragiratchi_presents_Memetchi_with_MC_Puppetchi.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20260505224249","caption":"Персонажи на изображении · Гирагиратчи, Мемэтчи","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/8/80/Giragiratchi_presents_Memetchi_with_MC_Puppetchi.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260505224249"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:GiraGira_1.PNG","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/9/9b/GiraGira_1.PNG/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20130804083254","caption":"Комната Giragiratchi","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/9/9b/GiraGira_1.PNG/revision/latest?cb=20130804083254"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:1344841224-0717-001.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/5/5d/1344841224-0717-001.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20121027185521","caption":"Из альбома «Гирагиратчи» · № 25","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/5/5d/1344841224-0717-001.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20121027185521"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:1344841224-0717-002.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/e/ea/1344841224-0717-002.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20121027185601","caption":"Giragiratchi зевая","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/e/ea/1344841224-0717-002.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20121027185601"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:GIRAGIRA_EGG_CURSE.PNG","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/9/99/GIRAGIRA_EGG_CURSE.PNG/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20130806095033","caption":"Giragiratchi и Rubytchi подвержены яичному проклятию","large":"h